{
  "description": "POST /v1/telemetry contract as pinned by internal/api telemetry tests. Derivation rows: POST {items:[{recommendation_id:<owned rec>, model_used:'claude-sonnet-4-6', ...item}]} -> 200 {accepted:1,dropped:0}; the stored outcome (read back via GET /v1/history/outcomes?recommendation_id=...) has outcome=expected. Drop rows: each single-item batch -> 200 exactly {\"accepted\":0,\"dropped\":1}. Envelope rows: 422 invalid_request with the exact message (details {} except where noted). Semantics of derivation live in reference/engine-reference.md (Part 4) (history).",
